sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Router as userRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB User

    Client->>Router: POST /api/users/login email, password
    Router->>DB: User.findOne(email)
    DB-->>Router: user or null

    alt User found and password matches
        Router->>DB: user.matchPassword(password)
        Note right of DB: bcrypt.compare(password, user.password)
        DB-->>Router: true
        Router->>Router: generateToken(user._id)
        Note right of Router: jwt.sign id, JWT_SECRET, expiresIn 30d
        Router-->>Client: 200 user object with token
    else User not found or wrong password
        Router-->>Client: 401 Invalid email or password
    end

    Note over Router,Client: On thrown error, catch returns 400 with error.message
